message: "If you use this software, please cite the archived release."
title: "Biofermentor Virtual SC"
type: software
version: "3.0.0"
date-released: "2026-08-16"
license: "BSD-3-Clause"
authors:
  - family-names: "Pereira Filho"
    given-names: "Renato Dutra"
    affiliation: "Universidade Federal do Rio Grande — FURG"
abstract: >-
  Biofermentor Virtual SC is an open, auditable virtual fermentation platform for
  Saccharomyces cerevisiae ethanol process-control studies. Version 3.0 separates
  growth-associated substrate demand from a bounded non-growth-associated
  fermentative catabolic flux under nitrogen limitation, while retaining dynamic
  C/N/O2 integrity audits, sensitivity and practical-identifiability screening,
  bounded parameter estimation, and frozen-parameter independent-validation
  workflows. The new non-growth-associated catabolic parameters are
  phenomenological reference values and are not calibrated to a specific strain,
  medium, vessel or industrial process; v3.0.0 does not claim quantitative
  experimental validation.
keywords:
  - bioprocess control
  - fermentation
  - Saccharomyces cerevisiae
  - process simulation
  - parameter estimation
  - external validation
  - reproducible research
